### shush API manual test snippets
### Base URL
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8100

### Create local session
POST {{base}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "dev-local",
  "host": ""
}

### Create remote session (SSH alias)
POST {{base}}/api/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "dev-1",
  "host": "shush-docker"
}

### List sessions
GET {{base}}/api/sessions

### Get one session (replace id)
GET {{base}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### Submit command
POST {{base}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}?action=submit
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "command": "echo hello"
}

### Approve current pending command
POST {{base}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}?action=approve

### Deny current pending command
POST {{base}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}?action=deny

### List command cards (newest first)
GET {{base}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/commands?limit=10

### Delete session
DELETE {{base}}/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}

### WebSocket stream (use a WS client)
### URL: ws://127.0.0.1:8100/api/sessions/{{sessionId}}/stream
### Expected server messages:
### {"type":"snapshot","data":"<base64>"}
### {"type":"terminal","data":"<base64>"}
### {"type":"card","card":{...}}
